Read docs/cursor-handoff/06-DOMAIN-ONBOARDING-V2.md and current service/provider code.
V2 visible From and SES identity use customer.com. send.customer.com is infrastructure only; MAIL FROM is bounce.send.customer.com and tracking click.send.customer.com.
Preserve provisioningVersion and V1 compatibility. Never relabel existing domains without a tested migration of DNS, identities, routes and pinned history.
Use SES DkimAttributes.SigningHostedZone for Easy DKIM; never hard-code dkim.amazonses.com or substitute BYODKIM silently.
Customer setup is four NS plus three root DKIM CNAME records. Preserve customer root DMARC; do not silently overwrite it.
Preserve stable CallerReference, ownership validation, leases and retry-safe cleanup. Never delete shared delegation infrastructure or unrelated DNS.
Enforce backend readiness and sanitize customer diagnostics; raw AWS internals and credentials are server-only.
